===================================================================

SECRETS

===================================================================

.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

===================================================================

PYTHON BACKEND

===================================================================

Ignore the virtual environment folder

This is the "sandbox" that holds 'flask', 'pyodbc', etc.

venv/
.venv/

Ignore Python cache files

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

===================================================================

NODE.JS FRONTEND (Vite, React, Tailwind)

===================================================================

Ignore the massive folder of downloaded packages

This is the one causing all your "permission denied" errors.

node_modules/

Ignore the "dist" folder, which is the built, minified app

dist/
.dist/

Ignore Vite's cache and temp files

.vite/
*.log

Ignore npm debug logs

npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

===================================================================

IDE / EDITOR / OS FILES

===================================================================

Ignore Visual Studio Code settings

.vscode/

Ignore Operating System files

.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

===================================================================

CACHE DIRECTORIES

===================================================================

.npm
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
